      "reviewer_name": "Anonymous",
      "rating": null,
      "title": "Ok",
      "review_text": "So, I've been looking for a replacement to my previous charger. This is what I settled on. I say settled because it does not have everything I was looking for but it was inexpensive. My previous charger had three significant enhancements than this one does not have. My previous charger: 1. Folded flat - this one doesn't. 2. Was a battery pack along with a charger. This one isn't 3. Had a magnet charger. This one's not. This was none of those. It doesn't fold flat and it's not a charger and it's not magnetic. But it charges. And it was relatively inexpensive. I can charge my iPhone and my head phones at the same time which is nice and it requires one less cord. And it allows me to set my phone up during work. It's not great but it is okay. So if you're looking for a non-magnetic, non-battery pack, non-flat battery pack, that doesn't cost a lot but does charge and sets your phone up while you work - bingo. Otherwise, keep searching and let me know what you find.",
